# Files Vercel must never publish.
#
# Vercel serves this repo as static files, so it does NOT apply the static-file allowlist in
# server.js. Anything left here is downloadable by URL. Verified 2026-08-21: /server.js,
# /supabase_setup.sql and /SECURITY_FIXES_PROMPT.md were all returning 200 on the live site,
# and the security docs and SQL seed contain the admin phone number that grants admin access.

# Server source — never executed by Vercel, only leaked by it
server.js
lib/
verify_rls.mjs

# Database schema, RLS policies, admin seed rows
supabase_setup.sql

# Internal security audit documents and specs
*.md

# Runtime state and secrets
data/
.env
.env.*
